  "description": "Fast, fully offline MAC address to vendor lookup. Parses MAC addresses in any format (colon, hyphen, dot/Cisco, bare, spaced), validates them, and resolves the hardware vendor from the complete embedded IEEE registry (MA-L, MA-M and MA-S) -- 53,000+ assignments, 30,000+ vendors. Single or bulk lookups, zero allocations per lookup, no dependencies, no HTTP calls, no API key.",
